si un chapeau vert avec une fleur jaune.",[32,44,33,2,45,46,47,2,11,48]],["“Look, children!” says Mrs Green.","« Regardez, les enfants ! » dit Mme Green.",[49,8,50,39,40]],["“Here is Hill Farm!”","« Voici la ferme de Hill ! »",[51,52,53,17]],["The bus stops by a big gate.","Le bus s'arrête près d'un grand portail.",[7,12,54,20,2,3,55]],["The children get off the bus.","Les enfants descendent du bus.",[7,8,56,57,7,12]],["It is a lovely morning.","C'est une belle matinée.",[58,1,2,59,60]],["The sun is hot and the sky is blue.","Le soleil est chaud et le ciel est bleu.",[7,61,1,62,63,7,64,1,65]],["Everybody shouts, “Hooray!”","Tout le monde crie : « Hourra ! »",[66,67,68]]]],"m":[68,45,49,35,55,59,67,3,4,6,8,11],"t":"Chapter 1 — The big day","tf":"Chapitre 1 — Le grand jour"},{"p":[[["A tall man waits by the gate.","Un grand homme attend près du portail.",[2,69,70,71,20,7,55]],["He wears big boots and a straw hat.","Il porte de grandes bottes et un chapeau de paille.",[22,72,73,74,63,2,75,46]],["“Hello, children!” he says.","« Bonjour, les enfants ! » dit-il.",[76,8,22,50]],["“My name is Tom.","« Je m'appelle Tom.",[77,78,79,80]],["I am the farmer.","Je suis le fermier.",[81,82,7,83]],["Welcome to Hill Farm!”","Bienvenue à la ferme de Hill ! »",[84,85,53,17]]],[["Please follow me,” says Tom.","Suivez-moi, s'il vous plaît », dit Tom.",[86,87,88,50,80]],["“Do not run, please.","« Ne courez pas, s'il vous plaît.",[89,90,91,86]],["The animals are shy.","Les animaux sont timides.",[7,92,9,93]],["Be kind and quiet.","Soyez gentils et calmes.",[94,95,63,96]],["Today you can feed the hens.","Aujourd'hui, vous pouvez nourrir les poules.",[0,97,98,99,7,100]],["You can pet the cows, too.”","Vous pouvez aussi caresser les vaches. »",[97,98,101,7,102,103]]],[["There are many animals on the farm.","Il y a beaucoup d'animaux à la ferme.",[104,105,106,92,107,7,108]],["There are pigs, ducks and sheep.","Il y a des cochons, des canards et des moutons.",[104,105,109,110,63,111]],["A big brown cow looks at Leo.","Une grosse vache brune regarde Leo.",[2,112,113,114,115,116,117]],["“Moo!” says the cow.","« Meuh ! » dit la vache.",[118,50,7,114]],["Leo laughs and jumps back.","Leo rit et fait un bond en arrière.",[117,119,63,120,121]],["“Is it hungry?” asks Amira.","« A-t-elle faim ? » demande Amira.",[122,58,123,124,125]],["“Cows are always hungry,” says Tom.","« Les vaches ont toujours faim », dit Tom.",[102,126,127,128,50,80]],["“But goats are worse!”","« Mais les chèvres, c'est pire ! »",[129,130,9,131]]]],"m":[99,100,115,118,55,75,84,87,93,109,111,130]},{"p":[[["Something small and black runs to Karim.","Quelque chose de petit et de noir court vers Karim.",[132,133,63,134,135,136,18]],["It is a goat!","C'est une chèvre !",[58,1,2,137]],["It has a white spot on its nose.","Elle a une tache blanche sur le nez.",[58,33,2,138,139,140,141,142]],["Its ears are long and soft.","Ses oreilles sont longues et douces.",[143,144,9,145,63,146]],["Karim stops.","Karim s'arrête.",[18,54]],["Karim wants to say hello.","Karim veut lui dire bonjour.",[18,147,148,149,76]],["“Hello, little goat,” he says.","« Bonjour, petite chèvre », dit-il.",[76,150,137,22,50]],["The goat looks at him.","La chèvre le regarde.",[7,137,115,116,31]],["Then it says, “Meh-eh-eh!”","Puis elle fait : « Mé-é-é ! »",[151,58,152,153]]],[["“That is Pepper,” says Tom.","« C'est Pepper », dit Tom.",[154,155,156,50,80]],["“She likes you, Karim.”","« Elle t'aime bien, Karim. »",[32,157,97,18]],["“How can you know that?” asks Karim.","« Comment le sais-tu ? » demande Karim.",[158,159,97,160,161,124,18]],["“Look at her tail,” says Tom.","« Regarde sa queue », dit Tom.",[115,162,34,163,50,80]],["“It is going up and down.”","« Elle remue de haut en bas. »",[58,164,165,166,63,167]]],[["Karim smiles.","Karim sourit.",[18,168]],["He walks to the hens.","Il marche vers les poules.",[22,169,136,7,100]],["Pepper walks too.","Pepper marche aussi.",[156,169,103]],["He stops. She stops.","Il s'arrête. Elle s'arrête.",[22,54,32,54]],["“She follows me!” says Karim.","« Elle me suit ! » dit Karim.",[32,170,88,50,18]],["The class laughs.","La classe rit.",[7,6,119]],["Pepper is a new friend.","Pepper est une nouvelle amie.",[156,1,2,171,26]],["Chloé and Leo follow them.","Chloé et Leo les suivent.",[27,63,117,172,173]]]],"m":[153,139,115,167,100,137,146,163,170,133,134,135],"t":"Chapter 2 — Pepper","tf":"Chapitre 2 — Pepper"},{"p":[[["The class walks to the pond.","La classe marche vers la mare.",[7,6,169,136,7,174]],["Mrs Green opens her map.","Mme Green ouvre sa carte.",[39,40,175,34,42]],["A duck swims on the water.","Un canard nage sur l'eau.",[2,176,177,140,7,178]],["“Look, there is the pond,” she says.","« Regardez, voici la mare », dit-elle.",[49,179,180,7,174,32,50]],["“And there is the big barn.”","« Et voici la grande grange. »",[63,179,180,7,181,182]],["“Now we can see the pigs.”","« Maintenant, nous pouvons voir les cochons. »",[183,184,98,185,7,109]],["Pepper stands behind her.","Pepper se tient derrière elle.",[156,186,187,34]],["She is very quiet.","Elle est très calme.",[32,1,23,188]]],[["Slowly, Pepper takes the map.","Doucement, Pepper prend la carte.",[189,156,190,7,42]],["Crunch, crunch, crunch!","Croc, croc, croc !",[191,191,191]],["“Where is my map?” asks Mrs Green.","« Où est ma carte ? » demande Mme Green.",[192,1,193,42,124,39,40]],["She looks left. She looks right.","Elle regarde à gauche. Elle regarde à droite.",[32,115,194,32,115,195]],["Then she looks down.","Puis elle baisse les yeux.",[151,32,196,197]],["Pepper has a bit of paper in her mouth.","Pepper a un morceau de papier dans la bouche.",[156,33,2,198,199,200,36,34,201]],["“Oh no, Pepper!” says Karim.","« Oh non, Pepper ! » dit Karim.",[202,203,156,50,18]],["“That is not food!”","« Ce n'est pas de la nourriture ! »",[204,1,205,206]],["Mrs Green laughs.","Mme Green rit.",[39,40,119]],["“It is only a map,” she says.","« Ce n'est qu'une carte », dit-elle.",[58,1,207,2,42,32,50]],["“We can ask Farmer Tom.”","« Nous pouvons demander au fermier Tom. »",[184,98,208,83,80]],["Everybody looks for the map.","Tout le monde cherche la carte.",[66,209,210,7,42]]]],"m":[191,49,197,174,182,109,195,198,200,6,169,39]},{"p":[[["The class is at the pigs.","La classe est près des cochons.",[7,6,1,211,7,109]],["The pigs are pink and very loud.","Les cochons sont roses et très bruyants.",[7,109,9,212,63,23,213]],["Mrs Green puts her hat on the fence.","Mme Green pose son chapeau sur la clôture.",[39,40,214,34,46,140,7,215]],["“It is too hot,” she says.","« Il fait trop chaud », dit-elle.",[58,216,217,62,32,50]],["Everybody looks at the pigs.","Tout le monde regarde les cochons.",[66,115,218,7,109]],["Nobody looks at Pepper.","Personne ne regarde Pepper.",[219,115,218,156]],["Karim says hello to a big pig.","Karim dit bonjour à un gros cochon.",[18,50,76,220,2,3,221]]],[["Pepper jumps up on a box.","Pepper saute sur une caisse.",[156,222,223,140,2,38]],["She reaches the fence.","Elle atteint la clôture.",[32,224,7,215]],["She is quick and quiet.","Elle est rapide et silencieuse.",[32,1,225,63,226]],["Munch, munch, munch!","Miam, miam, miam !",[227,227,227]],["“My hat!” shouts Mrs Green.","« Mon chapeau ! » crie Mme Green.",[193,46,67,39,40]],["The yellow flower is in Pepper's mouth.","La fleur jaune est dans la bouche de Pepper.",[7,11,48,1,36,228,201]],["Chloé laughs and laughs.","Chloé rit et rit.",[27,119,63,119]],["“It is not funny,” says Mrs Green.","« Ce n'est pas drôle », dit Mme Green.",[229,1,205,230,50,39,40]],["But she is smiling.","Mais elle sourit.",[129,32,231,168]],["“You are a naughty goat, Pepper,” she says.","« Tu es une chèvre coquine, Pepper », dit-elle.",[232,9,2,233,137,156,32,50]],["Pepper looks at her with big eyes.","Pepper la regarde avec de grands yeux.",[156,115,218,34,47,234,235]],["“Stay with me, Pepper,” says Karim.","« Reste avec moi, Pepper », dit Karim.",[236,47,88,156,50,18]]]],"m":[215,227,115,224,109,213,67,233,137,6,212,39]},{"p":[[["It is ten o'clock.","Il est dix heures.",[58,1,237,238]],["“Time for a snack!” says Mrs Green.","« C'est l'heure du goûter ! » dit Mme Green.",[239,240,2,35,50,39,40]],["The children sit on the grass.","Les enfants s'assoient sur l'herbe.",[7,8,241,140,7,242]],["Chloé opens her red box.","Chloé ouvre sa boîte rouge.",[27,175,34,37,38]],["There is a cheese sandwich and two biscuits.","Il y a un sandwich au fromage et deux biscuits.",[243,244,2,245,246,63,247,248]],["“Mmm, I am so hungry,” says Chloé.","« Mmm, j'ai tellement faim », dit Chloé.",[249,81,250,251,252,50,27]],["Everybody is very hungry.","Tout le monde a très faim.",[66,253,23,123]],["The cows eat grass near the fence.","Les vaches mangent de l'herbe près de la clôture.",[7,102,254,242,255,7,215]]],[["Chloé puts the box on the grass.","Chloé pose la boîte sur l'herbe.",[27,214,7,38,140,7,242]],["Then she looks at the cows.","Puis elle regarde les vaches.",[151,32,115,218,7,102]],["Pepper looks at the box.","Pepper regarde la boîte.",[156,115,218,7,38]],["In one second, the box is empty!","En une seconde, la boîte est vide !",[36,256,257,7,38,1,258]],["“My sandwich!” cries Chloé.","« Mon sandwich ! » s'écrie Chloé.",[193,246,259,27]],["“My biscuits!”","« Mes biscuits ! »",[193,248]],["Pepper licks her mouth.","Pepper se lèche la bouche.",[156,260,34,201]],["She is very happy.","Elle est très contente.",[32,1,23,261]],["“Here, take my apple,” says Karim.","« Tiens, prends ma pomme », dit Karim.",[262,263,193,264,50,18]],["“Thank you, Karim,” says Chloé.","« Merci, Karim », dit Chloé.",[265,266,18,50,27]],["Tom laughs, “Pepper eats everything!”","Tom rit : « Pepper mange tout ! »",[80,119,156,267,268]]]],"m":[249,215,115,260,35,258,259,238,239,50,39,8]},{"p":[[["After the snack, Tom counts the lambs.","Après le goûter, Tom compte les agneaux.",[269,7,35,80,270,7,271]],["The lambs are in a small field.","Les agneaux sont dans un petit champ.",[7,271,9,36,2,133,272]],["The lambs are soft and white.","Les agneaux sont doux et blancs.",[7,271,9,273,63,274]],["They run and jump in the grass.","Ils courent et sautent dans l'herbe.",[13,275,63,276,36,7,242]],["“One, two, three, four, five, six, seven.”","« Un, deux, trois, quatre, cinq, six, sept. »",[277,247,278,279,280,281,282]],["Tom stops.","Tom s'arrête.",[80,54]],["“Seven?” he says.","« Sept ? » dit-il.",[282,22,50]],["“There are eight lambs.","« Il y a huit agneaux.",[104,105,283,271]],["Where is number eight?”","Où est le numéro huit ? »",[192,1,284,283]]],[["Tom looks at the gate.","Tom regarde le portail.",[80,115,218,7,55]],["It is open!","Il est ouvert !",[58,1,285]],["“Oh dear,” says Tom.","« Oh là là », dit Tom.",[286,287,50,80]],["“Cloud is not here.","« Cloud n'est pas là.",[288,1,205,289]],["She is a very small lamb.","C'est un tout petit agneau.",[32,1,2,23,133,290]],["She is white like a cloud.”","Elle est blanche comme un nuage. »",[32,1,138,291,2,292]],["The children look sad.","Les enfants ont l'air tristes.",[7,8,293,294]],["“Can we help?” asks Amira.","« Peut-on aider ? » demande Amira.",[98,184,295,124,125]],["“Yes, please,” says Tom.","« Oui, s'il vous plaît », dit Tom.",[296,86,50,80]],["“Look everywhere, but stay with a friend.”","« Cherchez partout, mais restez avec un ami. »",[297,298,129,299,47,2,300]],["Tom looks very worried.","Tom a l'air très inquiet.",[80,301,23,302]],["“Maybe she is lost,” says Tom.","« Elle s'est peut-être perdue », dit Tom.",[303,32,304,305,50,80]]]],"m":[271,115,35,272,273,55,287,302,270,133,274,275],"t":"Chapter 3 — The lost lamb","tf":"Chapitre 3 — L'agneau perdu"},{"p":[[["Mrs Green makes teams.","Mme Green fait des équipes.",[39,40,306,307]],["Each team has a part of the farm.","Chaque équipe a une partie de la ferme.",[308,309,33,2,310,43,7,17]],["Leo and Amira look by the pond.","Leo et Amira cherchent près de la mare.",[117,63,125,311,20,7,174]],["Chloé and two friends look in the hen house.","Chloé et deux amis cherchent dans le poulailler.",[27,63,247,312,311,36,7,313,314]],["Tom looks in the big field.","Tom cherche dans le grand champ.",[80,315,36,7,3,272]],["“Karim, you stay with me,” says Mrs Green.","« Karim, toi, tu restes avec moi », dit Mme Green.",[18,97,316,47,88,50,39,40]],["“And Pepper, too.”","« Et Pepper aussi. »",[63,156,103]]],[["“Cloud! Cloud!” shout the children.","« Cloud ! Cloud ! » crient les enfants.",[288,288,317,7,8]],["There are only hens.","Il n'y a que des poules.",[104,105,318,100]],["“Cluck, cluck!” go the hens.","« Cot, cot ! » font les poules.",[319,319,320,7,100]],["At the pond, there are only ducks.","À la mare, il n'y a que des canards.",[218,7,174,104,105,318,110]],["“Quack, quack!”","« Coin, coin ! »",[321,321]],["There is no lamb.","Il n'y a pas d'agneau.",[243,244,322,290]],["“We have no map,” sighs Mrs Green.","« Nous n'avons pas de carte », soupire Mme Green.",[184,323,324,42,325,39,40]],["“And I have no hat.”","« Et je n'ai pas de chapeau. »",[63,81,323,324,46]],["“But we have Pepper!” says Karim.","« Mais nous avons Pepper ! » dit Karim.",[129,184,323,156,50,18]],["Karim looks under a red tractor.","Karim cherche sous un tracteur rouge.",[18,315,326,2,37,327]],["Pepper looks too, but only for food.","Pepper cherche aussi, mais seulement de la nourriture.",[156,315,103,129,328,210,206]]]],"m":[319,321,325,311,313,290,307,310,174,272,317,327]},{"p":[[["Suddenly, Pepper stops.","Soudain, Pepper s'arrête.",[329,156,54]],["Her ears go up.","Ses oreilles se dressent.",[34,144,330,331]],["Her eyes are big and bright.","Ses yeux sont grands et brillants.",[34,235,9,234,63,332]],["She looks at the red barn.","Elle regarde la grange rouge.",[32,115,218,7,37,182]],["“What is it, Pepper?” asks Karim.","« Qu'y a-t-il, Pepper ? » demande Karim.",[333,334,335,156,124,18]],["Pepper runs!","Pepper court !",[156,135]],["She runs very fast.","Elle court très vite.",[32,135,23,336]],["Her small feet go tap, tap, tap.","Ses petits pieds font tap, tap, tap.",[34,337,338,339,340,340,340]],["Karim runs after her.","Karim court derrière elle.",[18,135,341,34]],["“Wait, Pepper!” he shouts.","« Attends, Pepper ! » crie-t-il.",[342,156,22,67]]],[["Mrs Green runs too.","Mme Green court aussi.",[39,40,135,103]],["Mrs Green is not very fast.","Mme Green n'est pas très rapide.",[39,40,1,205,23,343]],["“Oh dear, my legs!” she says.","« Oh là là, mes jambes ! » dit-elle.",[286,287,193,344,32,50]],["Pepper jumps over a small fence.","Pepper saute par-dessus une petite clôture.",[156,345,346,2,347,215]],["Karim jumps over it too.","Karim saute aussi par-dessus.",[18,345,346,348,103]],["They are at the barn door.","Ils sont à la porte de la grange.",[13,9,218,7,182,349]],["The door is a little open.","La porte est un peu ouverte.",[7,349,1,2,350,351]],["Pepper goes in.","Pepper entre.",[156,352,353]],["Karim follows her.","Karim la suit.",[18,170,34]],["It is dark and quiet inside.","Il fait sombre et calme à l'intérieur.",[58,354,355,63,188,356]],["Karim hears a small sound.","Karim entend un petit bruit.",[18,357,2,133,358]]]],"m":[215,115,336,340,329,332,182,67,287,170,356,54]},{"p":[[["“Baa... baa...”","« Bê… bê… »",[359,359]],["The sound comes from the hay.","Le bruit vient du foin.",[7,358,360,361,7,362]],["There is a big pile of hay.","Il y a un gros tas de foin.",[243,244,2,3,363,43,362]],["A little light comes in through the door.","Un peu de lumière entre par la porte.",[2,364,365,366,367,368,7,349]],["Pepper walks to the hay.","Pepper marche vers le foin.",[156,169,136,7,362]],["She puts her nose in it.","Elle y enfonce le nez.",[32,369,34,142,370,371]],["“Be careful,” whispers Karim.","« Fais attention », murmure Karim.",[372,373,374,18]]],[["Something white moves!","Quelque chose de blanc bouge !",[132,375,376]],["It is a small lamb!","C'est un petit agneau !",[58,1,2,133,290]],["“Cloud!” shouts Karim.","« Cloud ! » crie Karim.",[288,67,18]],["She says, “Baa!” in a tiny voice.","Elle fait « Bê ! » d'une toute petite voix.",[32,152,377,36,2,378,379]],["The lamb is behind a wooden box.","L'agneau est derrière une caisse en bois.",[7,290,1,187,2,380,38]],["She is tired and a little scared.","Elle est fatiguée et un peu effrayée.",[32,1,381,63,2,350,382]],["Karim moves the box.","Karim déplace la caisse.",[18,383,7,38]],["Cloud walks out.","Cloud sort en marchant.",[288,384,385]],["She and Pepper touch noses.","Elle et Pepper se touchent le nez.",[32,63,156,386,387]],["“Good girl, Pepper!” says Karim.","« Bravo, Pepper ! » dit Karim.",[388,389,156,50,18]],["“You are not a naughty goat.”","« Tu n'es pas une chèvre coquine. »",[232,9,205,2,233,137]],["Mrs Green arrives at the door.","Mme Green arrive à la porte.",[39,40,390,218,7,349]],["“Karim! Are you OK?” she asks.","« Karim ! Ça va ? » demande-t-elle.",[18,391,392,393,32,124]]]],"m":[359,393,362,374,290,363,373,67,378,379,380,382],"t":"Chapter 4 — The red barn","tf":"Chapitre 4 — La grange rouge"},{"p":[[["Karim carries Cloud out of the barn.","Karim porte Cloud hors de la grange.",[18,394,288,395,396,7,182]],["Tom runs across the field.","Tom court à travers le champ.",[80,135,397,7,272]],["“Cloud!” he cries.","« Cloud ! » s'écrie-t-il.",[288,22,259]],["He is so happy.","Il est si content.",[22,1,398,24]],["“Where is she?” he asks.","« Où est-elle ? » demande-t-il.",[192,1,32,22,124]],["“In the barn,” says Karim.","« Dans la grange », dit Karim.",[36,7,182,50,18]],["“Pepper finds her!”","« Pepper l'a trouvée ! »",[156,399,34]],["Tom puts his hand on Cloud's head.","Tom pose la main sur la tête de Cloud.",[80,214,25,400,140,401,402]],["The lamb looks tired, but she is fine.","L'agneau a l'air fatigué, mais il va bien.",[7,290,301,403,129,32,404,405]]],[["The children clap and cheer.","Les enfants applaudissent et poussent des cris de joie.",[7,8,406,63,407]],["“Hip, hip, hooray!”","« Hip, hip, hourra ! »",[408,408,68]],["Leo claps very loudly.","Leo applaudit très fort.",[117,409,23,410]],["Tom looks at Pepper.","Tom regarde Pepper.",[80,115,218,156]],["“You are not a naughty goat,” he says.","« Tu n'es pas une chèvre coquine », dit-il.",[232,9,205,2,233,137,22,50]],["“You are a hero!”","« Tu es une héroïne ! »",[232,9,2,411]],["He gives her a big red apple.","Il lui donne une grosse pomme rouge.",[22,412,34,2,112,37,264]],["Pepper eats it in one bite.","Pepper la mange en une bouchée.",[156,267,58,36,256,413]],["Chloé laughs.","Chloé rit.",[27,119]],["“Now she is full!” says Chloé.","« Maintenant, elle n'a plus faim ! » dit Chloé.",[183,32,414,415,50,27]],["“For two minutes, maybe,” says Karim.","« Pendant deux minutes, peut-être », dit Karim.",[416,247,417,303,50,18]]]],"m":[68,290,301,405,407,408,394,182,272,259,406,410],"t":"Chapter 5 — The best surprise","tf":"Chapitre 5 — La plus belle surprise"},{"p":[[["The class stands in front of the barn.","La classe se tient devant la grange.",[7,6,186,418,419,420,7,182]],["Tom has a small camera.","Tom a un petit appareil photo.",[80,33,2,133,421]],["“Say cheese!” says Tom.","« Dites ouistiti ! » dit Tom.",[422,423,50,80]],["Karim holds Cloud in his arms.","Karim tient Cloud dans ses bras.",[18,424,288,36,25,425]],["Pepper stands next to him.","Pepper se tient à côté de lui.",[156,186,29,30,31]],["Everybody smiles at the camera.","Tout le monde sourit à l'appareil photo.",[66,168,218,7,421]],["Mrs Green has no hat, but she smiles.","Mme Green n'a pas de chapeau, mais elle sourit.",[39,40,33,324,46,129,32,168]],["Click!","Clic !",[426]]],[["A photo comes out of the camera.","Une photo sort de l'appareil.",[2,427,428,429,43,7,421]],["Tom gives it to Mrs Green.","Tom la donne à Mme Green.",[80,412,58,430,39,40]],["“It is a gift for your class,” says Tom.","« C'est un cadeau pour votre classe », dit Tom.",[58,1,2,431,5,432,6,50,80]],["“Look at the photo!” says Amira.","« Regardez la photo ! » dit Amira.",[49,218,7,427,50,125]],["Pepper is eating Tom's hat!","Pepper est en train de manger le chapeau de Tom !",[156,433,434,435,46]],["Tom touches his head.","Tom se touche la tête.",[80,436,25,402]],["His hat is not there!","Son chapeau n'est plus là !",[25,46,1,205,437]],["Everybody laughs and laughs.","Tout le monde rit aux éclats.",[66,119,63,438]],["“Thank you, Tom,” says Mrs Green.","« Merci, Tom », dit Mme Green.",[265,266,80,50,39,40]],["“This is the best photo ever.”","« C'est la meilleure photo du monde. »",[439,1,7,440,427,441]],["Pepper says, “Meh!” with straw in her mouth.","Pepper fait « Mé ! », de la paille plein la bouche.",[156,152,442,47,75,36,34,201]]]],"m":[442,49,182,421,424,426,441,75,6,186,419,133]}],"questions":[{"q":"Où va la classe de Mme Green ?","o":["Dans une ferme","Dans un zoo","À la plage"],"i":"Relis la première page.","e":"La classe prend un bus jaune pour aller à la ferme de Hill."},{"q":"Que dit le fermier Tom aux enfants au début de la visite ?","o":["De ne pas courir et d'être gentils et calmes","De donner tout leur goûter aux animaux","De monter sur le dos des vaches"],"i":"Regarde la page 2.","e":"Tom demande aux enfants de ne pas courir, car les animaux sont timides, et d'être gentils et calmes."},{"q":"Qui est Pepper ?","o":["Une petite chèvre noire","Une vache brune","Un chien de la ferme"],"i":"C'est le sujet de la page 3.","e":"Pepper est une petite chèvre noire avec une tache blanche sur le nez. Elle suit Karim partout."},{"q":"Que mange Pepper la première fois ?","o":["La carte de Mme Green","Le chapeau de Mme Green","Le sandwich de Chloé"],"i":"Lis la page 4.","e":"Pepper prend la carte de la ferme et la mange : croc, croc, croc !"},{"q":"Qu'est-ce que Pepper mange pendant que tout le monde regarde les cochons ?","o":["La fleur jaune du chapeau de Mme Green","La corde du portail","La pomme de Karim"],"i":"Regarde la page 5.","e":"Mme Green pose son chapeau sur la clôture. Pepper saute sur une caisse et mange la fleur jaune du chapeau."},{"q":"Que donne Karim à Chloé après le goûter mangé par Pepper ?","o":["Sa pomme","Son chapeau","Sa carte"],"i":"Pense à la page 6.","e":"Pepper vide la boîte de Chloé. Karim lui donne alors sa pomme."},{"q":"Quel problème Tom découvre-t-il quand il compte les agneaux ?","o":["Il y en a sept au lieu de huit","Ils sont tous malades","Ils ont mangé son chapeau"],"i":"Lis la page 7.","e":"Tom compte sept agneaux au lieu de huit. Le portail est ouvert et la petite Cloud n'est plus là."},{"q":"Qui retrouve Cloud, et où ?","o":["Pepper la retrouve dans la grange","Tom la retrouve près de la mare","Leo la retrouve dans le poulailler"],"i":"Pense aux pages 9 et 10.","e":"Pepper court vers la grange rouge. Karim la suit et entend un petit « bê » : Cloud est derrière une caisse, dans le foin."},{"q":"Que fait Pepper sur la photo de la fin ?","o":["Elle mange le chapeau de Tom","Elle mange la photo","Elle dort dans le foin"],"i":"Regarde la dernière page.","e":"Tom offre une photo à la classe. Dessus, Pepper est en train de manger le chapeau de paille de Tom. Tout le monde rit aux éclats !"}]}